<title>USA: BCAM Intl to buy medical footwear co.</title>
<headline>BCAM Intl to buy medical footwear co.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>BCAM International Inc said that it has signed a letter of intent to acquire a privately held medical footwear company with $15 million in sales in 1996, and consistent profitability.</p>
<p>The name of the footwear company and terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
